<title>UK: Morgan Guaranty prices $300 mln seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>Morgan Guaranty prices $300 mln seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced earler, has been priced by lead manager J.P Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MORGAN GUARANTY TRUST CO</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	COUPON     6.625     MATURITY    30.JUN.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.928   PAY DATE    30.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.353    SPREAD	+25 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 1</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  MGT/UND    30 BP     SELL CONC   1.575</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.50 PCT MAY 2002 UST</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
